# Notifications & Toasts

## Toasts (react-hot-toast)

- Provider in `main.tsx`: `<Toaster position="top-right" />`
- Trigger in mutation `onSuccess`/`onError` or axios interceptor (401/403/422/5xx)
- Do not add a second toast library

## Notification bell

Data from `useNotifications()` in `features/notifications/api/`:

- Initial load: `GET /notifications` (base URL includes `/admin`)
- Live updates: Laravel Echo private channel `App.Models.User.{id}`
- Mark read: `POST /notifications/{id}/read`, `POST /notifications/read-all`

New broadcast events prepend to TanStack Query cache and may show a toast.

## Inline alerts

Use `alert.tsx` for persistent page-level messages, not transient feedback.
